* Task 3 fixture: SQL UPDATE statement (SET/WHERE form)
* Demonstrates FR-20 requirement: SQL UPDATE writes to DDM once
* Uses SET and WHERE clauses to disambiguate from Adabas record UPDATE
* Expected: one EdgeWrites entry for EMPLOYEES (the table operand)
* and zero edges for SET targets or WHERE operands (they are host vars/columns)

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #EMP-ID (N5)
  1 #NEW-SALARY (N9.2)
  1 #DEPT-ID (N3)
END-DEFINE

UPDATE EMPLOYEES SET SALARY = :#NEW-SALARY WHERE EMP_ID = :#EMP-ID AND DEPT = :#DEPT-ID

END
